WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:21.750
Obnoxious Celtic Guard attacks Ipiria!

00:01:23.660 --> 00:01:26.370
I activate my Deck Master's ability!

00:01:26.370 --> 00:01:27.300
He used it!

00:01:28.610 --> 00:01:31.400
I tribute Ipiria and Yowie!

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:33.640
Reflector Hole activates!

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:36.500
Your monster's attack is negated!

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:39.980
And you take damage equal to its attack points!

00:01:39.980 --> 00:01:40.910
Here it comes!

00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:51.020
Rainbow Arch's Counterattack

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:03.370
I will survive!

00:02:11.320 --> 00:02:12.500
I draw!

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:14.650
This is good.

00:02:14.650 --> 00:02:18.120
2200 attack points is a powerful bite.

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:23.970
But defeating him with Eingana isn't fun enough.

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:30.060
I summon Melchid the Four-Face Beast in attack position!

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:43.920
You probably won't get to attack again, but Obnoxious Celtic Guard is annoying.

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:50.280
A monster with 1900 or more attack points can't destroy it.

00:02:50.280 --> 00:02:56.580
So I must defeat you by attacking it and dealing you the remaining damage.

00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:01.330
Go!  Melchid the Four-Face Beast!

00:03:01.330 --> 00:03:06.860
Attack Obnoxious Celtic Guard and use the extra damage to bury Yugi!

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:45.040
Where am I?

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:53.440
Ouch!

00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:57.900
I couldn't touch anything before.

00:03:59.660 --> 00:04:01.140
Why can I now?

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:06.820
This is more than virtual reality.

00:04:07.710 --> 00:04:10.440
Will they end me?

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:18.140
It's over.

00:04:23.170 --> 00:04:25.010
I can't lose heart!

00:04:25.400 --> 00:04:27.800
Because everyone else...

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:30.780
...is trying hard too!

00:04:34.860 --> 00:04:35.880
What?

00:04:36.450 --> 00:04:38.090
It's not over.

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:42.230
I still have 400 life points.

00:04:42.600 --> 00:04:46.160
Sheesh.  He still has the strength to stand?

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:50.500
I can't take any more damage.

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:56.940
My body can't take another blow.

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:59.710
You should've stayed down.

00:04:59.710 --> 00:05:02.250
Too bad you stood up.

00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:04.600
I'll knock you down again!

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:14.600
If I attack his monster, his Deck Master's ability will defeat me.

00:05:14.820 --> 00:05:16.940
And I have zero cards.

00:05:16.940 --> 00:05:18.260
What can I do?

00:05:18.910 --> 00:05:20.540
I end my turn.

00:05:20.850 --> 00:05:25.220
Since you're on the verge of defeat, let me offer you words of hope.

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:31.510
A Prussian general said, “Laurels go to the final winner.”

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:36.570
No matter how victory is achieved, the one who wins in the end is the winner.

00:05:36.570 --> 00:05:38.170
So hang in there.

00:05:39.910 --> 00:05:42.540
My turn!  I draw!

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:45.320
Rainbow Blessing.

00:05:46.020 --> 00:05:51.000
Unfortunately, this card isn't good enough to change the situation.

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:53.710
Think carefully.

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:56.510
Here's another quote:

00:05:56.510 --> 00:06:04.280
“Trouble in good times spurs you into action, but trouble in bad times saps your spirits."

00:06:04.620 --> 00:06:07.770
How are your spirits?

00:06:07.770 --> 00:06:10.950
It's not good to think too much.

00:06:16.370 --> 00:06:17.340
Kuriboh.

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:19.390
What are you trying to say?

00:06:20.850 --> 00:06:26.480
I think Kuriboh wants you to set that card.

00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:36.170
In order to alter the flow, I have to trust your Deck Master's ability, Kuriboh!

00:06:38.200 --> 00:06:39.110
Yeah.

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:42.580
I set a card!

00:06:45.970 --> 00:06:47.070
I end my turn!

00:06:50.620 --> 00:06:51.920
Where's my opponent?

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:54.550
How long do I have to wait?

00:06:54.550 --> 00:06:57.880
Come out already and duel!

00:07:14.320 --> 00:07:16.050
You have to be kidding me.

00:07:16.050 --> 00:07:18.120
I have to escape.

00:07:32.610 --> 00:07:35.500
You're saving me?

00:08:00.800 --> 00:08:03.260
Why does it feel so real?

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:08.200
Is this virtual reality a cutting-edge system?

00:08:09.400 --> 00:08:12.160
Virtual reality with sensory functions?

00:08:14.480 --> 00:08:18.000
You still don't understand, Seto.

00:08:19.760 --> 00:08:28.450
The system you built had a safety mechanism so that a person's mind and body weren't harmed.

00:08:28.850 --> 00:08:30.700
But this sense of reality...

00:08:31.100 --> 00:08:35.020
It's not possible if there's a safety mechanism.

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:39.360
This world is filled with danger.

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:42.070
What is Noa thinking?

00:08:42.280 --> 00:08:45.070
Come out if you want me!

00:08:50.490 --> 00:08:51.380
Mokuba.

00:08:51.660 --> 00:08:53.360
What is it, big brother?

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:57.910
We don't need the past on the road we're traveling.

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:06.570
But what I cherish most hasn't changed.

00:09:06.780 --> 00:09:08.280
Let's go, Mokuba.

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:12.650
Big brother!

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:22.370
It's my turn.  I draw!

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:28.580
I activate the Quick-Play Spell Offerings to the Doomed from my hand!

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:33.450
I'll destroy Chimera, your only attack option!

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:41.760
Offerings to the Doomed destroys one faceup monster!

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:52.340
But Chimera's effect activates when it's destroyed!

00:09:53.380 --> 00:09:55.740
I Special Summon Berfomet!

00:10:00.140 --> 00:10:02.040
Nothing changes.

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:05.430
Actually, it's worse for you.

00:10:05.430 --> 00:10:06.120
What?

00:10:06.570 --> 00:10:11.110
I tribute Wall of Illusion and Melchid the Four-Face Beast!

00:10:11.970 --> 00:10:15.350
I summon Rainbow Snake Eingana!

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:27.770
Rainbow Snake Eingana attacks Berfomet!

00:10:40.630 --> 00:10:43.420
Your defense is gone.

00:10:43.420 --> 00:10:45.920
A castle without walls is good as destroyed.

00:10:46.150 --> 00:10:48.370
I have 400 life points.

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:52.090
If Ruklamba attacks me, I'm finished.

00:10:52.600 --> 00:10:55.030
This truly is the end.

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:29.930
They found me!

00:11:36.820 --> 00:11:40.420
I'll unleash my final attack.

00:11:42.150 --> 00:11:46.410
I'll get a body again.  Thank you.

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:50.600
Ruklamba the Spirit King attacks you directly!

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:52.760
Go, Ruklamba!

00:11:55.570 --> 00:11:56.970
Am I done for?

00:11:58.740 --> 00:11:59.770
I win-

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:07.440
What?

00:12:11.770 --> 00:12:13.240
How dare you!

00:12:13.240 --> 00:12:15.520
Erase his life points!

00:12:28.140 --> 00:12:29.850
Thank you, Kuriboh!

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:33.460
You're Yugi Type A!

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:35.300
Why didn't you lose life points?

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:41.540
When I'm in danger, my Deck Master Kuriboh multiplies and creates a wall!

00:12:42.970 --> 00:12:45.700
Partner, why did you take my place?

00:12:45.960 --> 00:12:50.700
If you took more damage, your spirit wouldn't have survived.

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:53.960
And I hadn't taken damage yet.

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:56.280
Thanks, partner.

00:12:56.910 --> 00:12:59.080
You should thank Kuriboh instead.

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:03.050
Kuriboh created a wall to protect our life points.

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:03.880
I see.

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:06.460
That's Kuriboh's Deck Master ability.

00:13:06.970 --> 00:13:12.680
In this system, you have an advantage if your heart is one with your Deck Master.

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:18.410
But as a duelist, it's only natural to connect with my monster.

00:13:18.700 --> 00:13:23.340
Yeah.  I may have forgotten that important fact.

00:13:25.230 --> 00:13:26.200
Partner!

00:13:28.420 --> 00:13:32.080
You didn't lose points, but you suffered heavy damage.

00:13:32.320 --> 00:13:34.590
Leave this to Kuriboh and me!

00:13:40.020 --> 00:13:43.120
Your Deck Master saved you.

00:13:43.120 --> 00:13:48.200
But do you remember the risk for summoning your Deck Master?

00:13:48.420 --> 00:13:54.420
If your Deck Master is destroyed, you will lose regardless of your life points.

00:13:54.420 --> 00:14:00.010
Kuriboh can't survive my monster's next attack.

00:14:00.330 --> 00:14:04.530
My next attack will definitely finish you!

00:14:05.140 --> 00:14:07.120
I won't give up on this duel!

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:29.880
They're coming!

00:15:00.050 --> 00:15:01.260
Oh no...

00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:40.550
This is the symbol of our friendship.

00:15:40.550 --> 00:15:44.550
Yeah!  Even when we're apart, this ring unites us!

00:15:45.260 --> 00:15:48.060
I know my friends are fighting hard.

00:15:48.060 --> 00:15:50.060
Be courageous, Anzu!

00:16:18.420 --> 00:16:19.800
Stay away!

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:24.370
Stop!  You're breaking the bridge!

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:26.460
Oh no!

00:16:58.370 --> 00:17:01.570
I refuse to die here!

00:17:01.570 --> 00:17:03.840
I won't give up!

00:17:10.040 --> 00:17:15.220
Just as he says, I can't win unless I defeat him this turn.

00:17:16.820 --> 00:17:18.060
My turn!

00:17:21.150 --> 00:17:22.860
I know, Kuriboh.

00:17:22.860 --> 00:17:26.020
The duelist and Deck Master's hearts are one.

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:28.190
It all depends on this draw.

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:28.990
I draw!

00:17:30.620 --> 00:17:32.700
I want to tell you something.

00:17:33.800 --> 00:17:39.620
You may know a lot of old quotations, but those words aren't your own.

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:45.020
As an adult, you should digest those quotes before repeating them.

00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:51.150
You said, “Laurels go to the final winner.”

00:17:51.150 --> 00:17:55.850
I'll make those words mine and send them back to you!

00:17:55.850 --> 00:17:57.800
What are you insinuating?

00:17:57.800 --> 00:18:00.150
What did you draw?

00:18:01.040 --> 00:18:01.960
This!

00:18:02.300 --> 00:18:04.970
Swift Gaia the Fierce Knight?

00:18:06.540 --> 00:18:10.320
Did you forget that my combo is perfect?

00:18:10.320 --> 00:18:16.970
No matter how powerful of a monster you draw, your attack can't reach me.

00:18:16.970 --> 00:18:21.410
I have many more life points than you, so you can't make a comeback.

00:18:21.640 --> 00:18:23.240
Are you sure?

00:18:26.850 --> 00:18:28.680
I flip over my set card!

00:18:28.680 --> 00:18:31.690
The spell card Rainbow Blessing!

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:36.500
I equip Rainbow Blessing on my Deck Master, Kuriboh!

00:18:42.600 --> 00:18:44.430
What are you trying to do?

00:18:48.430 --> 00:18:50.400
Go, Kuriboh!

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:52.010
Rainbow Arch!

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:54.970
Rainbow Arch?

00:18:58.000 --> 00:19:00.350
What are you doing?

00:19:00.350 --> 00:19:05.180
I summon Swift Gaia the Fierce Knight in attack position!

00:19:06.140 --> 00:19:09.320
Come out, Swift Gaia the Fierce Knight!

00:19:14.190 --> 00:19:18.930
Rainbow Blessing creates a rainbow arch that goes over your monster...

00:19:18.930 --> 00:19:21.930
...allowing me to attack you directly!

00:19:22.930 --> 00:19:24.080
What?

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:26.310
Kuriboh has that effect?

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:34.160
Go, Swift Gaia the Fierce Knight!

00:19:34.160 --> 00:19:37.000
Attack Deepsea Warrior directly!

00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:38.150
Oh no!

00:19:38.550 --> 00:19:42.090
My Deck Master's ability can't be used against a direct attack!

00:19:42.090 --> 00:19:43.520
Exactly.

00:19:43.520 --> 00:19:49.370
You can only activate your Deck Master's ability when I attack your monster!

00:19:54.450 --> 00:19:56.480
How dare you!

00:19:56.480 --> 00:20:02.620
I was so close to getting my body back and returning to the real world!

00:20:17.110 --> 00:20:18.940
I found a way to win.

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:22.420
The damage I took was life-threatening.

00:20:22.800 --> 00:20:26.640
Are the others also facing this type of duel?

00:20:30.280 --> 00:20:32.260
Thank you, Kuriboh.

00:20:40.620 --> 00:20:43.720
Is Yugi stronger than I expected?

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:50.350
Or maybe The Big Five's skills are limited.

00:20:50.800 --> 00:20:55.660
Well, I hope they entertain me more in the next duel.

00:21:05.370 --> 00:21:07.650
It's the exit!  We did it!

00:21:07.650 --> 00:21:08.110
Yeah.

00:21:08.770 --> 00:21:11.040
Let's hurry.  I'm worried about everyone.

00:21:11.530 --> 00:21:14.460
Yeah.  We must reunite quickly.

00:21:14.460 --> 00:21:16.480
The duels are too dangerous!

00:21:46.600 --> 00:21:51.680
I escaped from the Hitotsu-Me Giants when another penguin appeared.

00:21:52.220 --> 00:21:54.320
You want me to follow you?

00:21:54.320 --> 00:21:56.340
Where are you taking me?

00:21:56.340 --> 00:21:59.250
Whoa!  There are a lot of penguins!

00:21:59.250 --> 00:22:02.110
Is this The Big Five's trap?

00:22:02.110 --> 00:22:06.620
Then I'll take on this duel!

00:22:07.460 --> 00:22:10.910
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Duel on Ice  Anzu in Danger

00:22:10.910 --> 00:22:12.510
Duel, standby!

00:22:15.460 --> 00:22:23.360
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:23.360 --> 00:22:32.310
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:32.640 --> 00:22:37.280
The straight rail and harsh route

00:22:37.280 --> 00:22:41.250
Whether to go or not 
all of yourself

00:22:41.680 --> 00:22:49.220
I'm tired of counting on my fingers inside this cage

00:22:49.220 --> 00:22:52.790
Respect! Boys  Show me how you act tough

00:22:52.790 --> 00:22:57.560
Draw a map, even if it's sloppy

00:22:57.560 --> 00:23:07.670
And walk it without stopping

00:23:07.670 --> 00:23:15.280
The sun never sets
If I can be like you

00:23:15.510 --> 00:23:24.250
Create freedom by exceeding common ideas

00:23:24.250 --> 00:23:32.230
I want to trust myself
Sometimes I'll lose my way but

00:23:32.230 --> 00:23:42.070
I hide it in my heart...
Secret Paradise
